text:
Download Hive
I en browser, søg efter “hive download”. Naviger frem til den nyeste, find de binære filer.
Netop nu er version 4.2.1 den seneste.
Download med wget
wget https://dlcdn.apache.org/hive/hive-q.q.q/apache-hive-q.q.q-bin.tar.gz


udpak
tar xvzf apache-hive-q.q.q-bin.tar.gz -C BigData


Redier hive-miljø i .bashrc
export HIVE_HOME="/home/[user]/BigData/apache-hive-q.q.q-bin"
export PATH=$PATH:$HIVE_HOME/bin
export HADOOP_CONF_DIR=$HADOOP_HOME/etc/Hadoop
Bemærk [user] er din user, q.q.q er den version du har downloaded. Husk: source .bashrc


Kopier hive konfigurationsfil
cp BigData/apache-hive-4.2.1-bin/conf/hive-default.xml.template BigData/apache-hive-4.2.1-bin/conf/hive-site.xml
q.q.q bla bla


Gør Hive til proxy for hadoop
Rediger $HadoopHome/etc/Hadoop/core-site.xml
Tilføj:
&lt;property&gt;
    &lt;name&gt;hadoop.proxyuser.[user].groups&lt;/name&gt;
    &lt;value&gt;*&lt;/value&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;
&lt;property&gt;
    &lt;name&gt;hadoop.proxyuser.[user].hosts&lt;/name&gt;
    &lt;value&gt;*&lt;/value&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;
&lt;property&gt;
    &lt;name&gt;hadoop.proxyuser.server.hosts&lt;/name&gt;
    &lt;value&gt;*&lt;/value&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;
&lt;property&gt;
    &lt;name&gt;hadoop.proxyuser.server.groups&lt;/name&gt;
    &lt;value&gt;*&lt;/value&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;


Genstart hadoop
$HADOOP_HOME/sbin/stop-all.sh 
$HADOOP_HOME/sbin/start-all.sh 


Opret mapper og set rettighedder INDE i HDFS
hdfs dfs -mkdir /tmp
hdfs dfs -mkdir /user
hdfs dfs -mkdir /user/hive
hdfs dfs -mkdir /user/hive/warehouse
hdfs dfs -chmod g+w /tmp
hdfs dfs -chmod g+w /user/hive/warehouse


Opdater hives mappe indstillinger i hive-site.xml
Rediger $HIVE_HOME/conf/hive-site.xml Find disse propperties og opdater deres værdier:
&lt;property&gt;
      &lt;name&gt;hive.metastore.warehouse.dir&lt;/name&gt;
      &lt;value&gt;/user/hive/warehouse&lt;/value&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;
&lt;property&gt;
      &lt;name&gt;hive.downloaded.resources.dir&lt;/name&gt;
      &lt;value&gt;/tmp/${user.name}_resources&lt;/value&gt;
      &lt;description&gt;&lt;/description&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;
&lt;property&gt;
      &lt;name&gt;hive.exec.local.scratchdir&lt;/name&gt;
      &lt;value&gt;/tmp/${user.name}&lt;/value&gt;
      &lt;description&gt;Local scratch space for Hive jobs&lt;/description&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;
